{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12303670","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12303670","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230367001:1":{"text":"네, 러스트 항이 봉쇄된 후부터 장사가 잘 안되네요...","source_cn":"是啊，锈锚港被封锁后，大家的买卖都不好做……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C9FD7BDD5431FC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230367002:1":{"text":"하지만 제가 매일 노점에 나오는 건, 사실 장사를 하기 위해서가 아니에요.","source_cn":"但人家每天出摊，其实不是为了做买卖啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1F6994E621CE975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230367003:1":{"text":"누군갈 기다리고 있어요.","source_cn":"人家是在等一个人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D08AB72CCE1BAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230367004:1":{"text":"그녀는 매일 블러드 플라워를 따는 습관이 있어요. 이곳에서 기다리면 그녀를 볼 수 있을지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"她每天有采血薇花的习惯，只要在这里守着，也许就能见到她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAE532D08B3D795B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卖花女格妮":{"text":"꽃팔이 그니","source":"卖花女格妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}